{"title": "Charm", "pageid": 40227, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Charm", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Charm.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Charm.webp/300px-Charm.webp, /w/images/c/c1/Charm.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Charm.webp/300px-Charm.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Charm.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Charm</b> is a Passive feature/Reaction and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a> that lets you charm an enemy that attacks you.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Channel the dark allure of the tadpole to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">Charm</a> an enemy that attacks you, preventing them from attacking you until their next turn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tadpole_Charm\" title=\"Tadpole Charm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/40px-Charm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/60px-Charm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/80px-Charm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tadpole Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/40px-Charm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tadpole_Charm\" title=\"Tadpole Charm\">Tadpole Charm</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Mind_Flayer_(Goblin_Camp)\" title=\"Dead Mind Flayer (Goblin Camp)\">Dead Mind Flayer (Goblin Camp)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Guardian\" title=\"Dream Guardian\">Dream Guardian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">Full-illithid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer_(nautiloid_wreck)\" title=\"Mind flayer (nautiloid wreck)\">Mind flayer (nautiloid wreck)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer_(windmill)\" title=\"Mind flayer (windmill)\">Mind flayer (windmill)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayers\" title=\"Mind flayers\">Mind flayers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Omeluum\" title=\"Omeluum\">Omeluum</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_Queller\" title=\"Rage Queller\">Rage Queller</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unlock with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining the following <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a>:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/38px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/50px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Favourable Beginnings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\">Favourable Beginnings</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Obtained automatically after becoming a Full-Illithid</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The saving throw does not always appear in the combat log.</li>\n<li>The charm takes effect <i>after</i> the triggering attack, so this is mainly useful against creatures that can make multiple attacks in a turn.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">charm</a> an attacking enemy, preventing further attacks until their next turn.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1172/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9741/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4115/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 808/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 832956/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.251      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   42.251      1 -total\n 34.95%   14.768      1 Template:Cond\n 32.59%   13.769      3 Template:Icon_link\n 31.45%   13.286      3 Template:Icon_text\n 26.77%   11.312      6 Template:Trim\n 25.42%   10.742      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 20.60%    8.705      3 Template:Ifempty\n 16.47%    6.960      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.88%    4.595      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40227-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202503 and revision id 371274. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}